# discoflix/.env.example
# Discoflix has no secrets managed via .env. All configuration (Discord bot token,
# Radarr/Sonarr API keys, Discord server and channel IDs) is done through the
# web UI at http://your-host:5454 after first launch.
#
# No .env file is required for this service.
# Update TZ and volume paths directly in compose.yaml.
